  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Human Rights of LGBT People in Myanmar&apos;s Education System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will sensitize students and teachers in two divisions in Myanmar on issues related to sexual orientation and gender identity and human rights, increasing their knowledge and awareness. The project also seeks to develop action plans togehter with secondary school teachers and administrators to reduce homophobia and transphobia, in turn imrpoving access to education for LGBTI persons.</narrative>
  </description>
